+repository log SHA-256 is
+`14a13be2dcf536f2396e0fc93c2ca406fbec586b3f228c35f52cf163acd7ccbf`;
+HTTPS log SHA-256 is
+`35362ca621bdbfee6ae9181e30a77f709c52e6ed57f9d1810ef5bc6907bf76c1`.
